\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.1}{\ignorespaces Dependency graph of correspondence lemmas relating the symbolic and concrete semantics of lane-wise binary vector operations. Each lemma relates one layer of abstraction from each side.}}{40}{figure.6.1}%
