\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7.1}{\ignorespaces XMM vectorized field addition for Curve25519. Adds five 64-bit limbs using 128-bit \texttt {vpaddq} instructions, processing two limbs per iteration with a single-limb tail.}}{46}{figure.7.1}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7.2}{\ignorespaces Batched YMM field addition for Curve25519. Each 256-bit \texttt {vpaddq} adds the same limb position across four independent field elements stored in structure-of-arrays layout.}}{47}{figure.7.2}%
